You call upon the mighty claw of a cold drake and rake a wave of freezing cold in front of you, doing [136%, 147%, 156%, 163%, 170% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as Ice damage in a cone of radius 3. Ice damage gives a chance of freezing the target.

Every level in Ice Claw additionally raises your Physical Save by 2.

Each point in cold drake talents also increases your cold resistance by 1%.

This talent will also attack with your shield, if you have one equipped.
